@keycloak = http://localhost:8180

### discovery document the app reads at startup
GET {{keycloak}}/realms/learn/.well-known/openid-configuration

### signing keys used to verify the ID token
GET {{keycloak}}/realms/learn/protocol/openid-connect/certs

### app entry (302 to Keycloak with PKCE + nonce)
GET http://localhost:8125/
